# Copy this file to .env (which is gitignored) and fill in real values from
# your Supabase project's dashboard: Project Settings -> API.
#
# Both of these are safe to expose to the browser (the "publishable"/anon
# key is designed for that) — actual data access is enforced server-side by
# Postgres Row Level Security policies, not by keeping this key secret.
# Never put a Supabase *service role* key here or anywhere client-reachable.

PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
